              "Completed the **B03 preparatory analysis**.\n\nUnder explicit bounds on the saved inputs, the same comparison’s complete error allowance is **less than \\(1/15\\)** of the reference margin at \\((r,k)=(4,1)\\), yielding the conditional bound \\(Q_{4,1}>3\\times10^{-31}\\). Exact verification of those input bounds remains pending.\n\nI also proved that the entrywise estimate used here cannot remain uniformly small at large moment indices. **Full B03 remains gated.**\n\nSaved:\n\n- [Analytical note](/Users/ebbaker/Documents/shifted-zeta-positivity/papers/investigations-5/07_positive_theta_primitives/01_jensen/01_mellin_curvature/10_radial_green_determinants/notes/05_RGD_B03_PREPARATORY_ORDER_DEPENDENCE_20261104.md)\n- [Progress register](/Users/ebbaker/Documents/shifted-zeta-positivity/papers/investigations-5/07_positive_theta_primitives/01_jensen/01_mellin_curvature/10_radial_green_determinants/research-progress/01_RADIAL_GREEN_DETERMINANTS_RESEARCH_PROGRESS_20261104.md)\n- [Execution and model-change handoff](/Users/ebbaker/Documents/shifted-zeta-positivity/papers/investigations-5/07_positive_theta_primitives/01_jensen/01_mellin_curvature/10_radial_green_determinants/research-progress/handoffs/08_RGD_E02_R2_EXISTING_DATA_NEXT_ORDER_AND_MODEL_CHANGE_20261104.md)\n\nChat history was refreshed; final capture is queued.\n\n**Next: [E] RGD-E02 r2 — Sol:** verify the fixed inequalities using the existing certificate. No new integration is needed."
